pe=\"main\">Action2: click[b07l2l64xl] Instruction: I need a fluoride free toothpaste for fresh breath. I will need a pack of 4 in 3.5 ounce size</title>\n\t</analytic>\n\t<monogr>\n\t\t<title level=\"m\">Action1: search</title>\n\t\t<imprint/>\n\t</monogr>\n\t<note>fluoride free toothpaste 3.5 oz pack of 4 price &lt; 50.00 and price lower than 50.00 dollars. B08DR4SDLJ</note>\n</biblStruct>\n\n<biblStruct status=\"extracted\" xml:id=\"b76\">\n\t<analytic>\n\t\t<title level=\"a\" type=\"main\">Action1: search</title>\n\t\t<idno>08DQS3T87] B07L2LN685</idno>\n\t</analytic>\n\t<monogr>\n\t\t<title level=\"j\">Action</title>\n\t\t<imprint>\n\t\t\t<biblScope unit=\"volume\">2</biblScope>\n\t\t</imprint>\n\t</monogr>\n\t<note>Action3: click[pack of 4] GT Reward = 1.0 B08DQS3T87 .. toothpaste fresh breath fluoride free 4 pack 3.5 oz price &lt; 50.00</note>\n</biblStruct>\n\n<biblStruct status=\"extracted\" xml:id=\"b77\">\n\t<analytic>\n\t\t<title/>\n\t\t<idno>GT Reward = 0.75</idno>\n\t</analytic>\n\t<monogr>\n\t\t<title level=\"j\">Action</title>\n\t\t<imprint>\n\t\t\t<biblScope unit=\"volume\">3</biblScope>\n\t\t</imprint>\n\t</monogr>\n</biblStruct>\n\n<biblStruct status=\"extracted\" xml:id=\"b78\">\n\t<monogr>\n\t\t<title level=\"m\" type=\"main\">Action1: look around Action2: teleport to outside Instruction: Your task is to find the animal with the longest life span, then the shortest life span</title>\n\t\t<imprint/>\n\t</monogr>\n\t<note>5 ounce (pack of 4</note>\n</biblStruct>\n\n<biblStruct status=\"extracted\" xml:id=\"b79\">\n\t<monogr>\n\t\t<title level=\"m\" type=\"main\">focus on the animal with the longest life span. Then, focus on the animal with the shortest life span. The animals are in the &apos;outside&apos; location. Action3: look around Observation3: Here you see: … an axe, a baby chipmunk, a baby dragonfly … a parrot egg Action5: focus on baby dragonfly (Thought: Dragonflies are known to have a relatively short life span</title>\n\t\t<author>\n\t\t\t<persName><surname>First</surname></persName>\n\t\t</author>\n\t\t<imprint/>\n\t</monogr>\n\t<note>typically ranging from a few weeks to a few months</note>\n</biblStruct>\n\n<biblStruct status=\"extracted\" xml:id=\"b80\">\n\t<monogr>\n\t\t<title level=\"m\" type=\"main\">Action4: focus on parrot egg (Thought: A parrot is a type of bird, and birds are known to live for many years. The life span of a parrot can be quite long, often exceeding 30 years in some species. ) Observation4: You focus on the parrot egg. Observation5: You focus on the baby dragonfly. Action1: look around Action2: teleport to outside Action3: look around Observation3: Here you see: … an axe, a baby chipmunk, a baby dragonfly … a parrot egg Action5: focus on baby chipmunk (Thought: I need to focus on the animal with the shortest life span, which is the baby chipmunk.) Observation1: This room is called the art studio</title>\n\t\t<idno>GT Reward = 1.0 GT Reward = 0.83</idno>\n\t\t<imprint/>\n\t</monogr>\n\t<note>In it, you see: the agent Observation2: You teleport to the outside ARMAP Selected ARMAP Aborted Observation1: This room is called the art studio In it, you see: the agent, a substance called air, a large cupboard. Observation2: You teleport to the outside. Action4: focus on parrot egg Thought: A parrot is a type of bird, and birds are known to live for many years. The life span of a parrot can be quite long, often exceeding 30 years in some species.</note>\n</biblStruct>\n\n\t\t\t\t</listBibl>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</back>\n\t</text>\n</TEI>\n","pdf_hash":"7478a9c6027b0dd464c10a3632939a012d2aed75141b4728822483cda36760ec","tables":[{"table_id":"tab_0","section_path_id":"1~20","section_ordinal":31,"caption":"Table 1 :","coordinates":null,"cells":[{"row":0,"column":0,"colspan":3,"rowspan":1,"text":"Backbone Algorithms Webshop","coordinates":null,"span":{"start":155,"end":182},"digest":"83c8560c4122aa935b1a9096f71c905a123672954f53c3b54b14ea2f4213bb4a"},{"row":0,"column":3,"colspan":4,"rowspa